# Remember to never publicly share your keystore.
# key.properties and app/guidy-release-key.jks ARE force-added to the PRIVATE
# guidy-app repo (owner's decision, 2026-09-16) so a fresh clone signs like the
# PC. tool/make_ci_snapshot.sh strips them from the public CI mirror and CI
# fails if they ever appear in a public repo. These lines stay so other
# keystores are not picked up by accident.
# See https://flutter.dev/to/reference-keystore
key.properties
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks
